    "reviews": "\u201cI had a great time playing it. Simply\u2026Genius\u2026 It\u2019d be unfair to make a comment this short and I really should do justice. This game is extremely simple but still manages to put a smile on my face.\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 JavaSaurus<br><br>\u201cBefore I played Loop, I had a small pp, no friends, no gf, depression, and no life. These things havent changed, but the game is pretty good\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 Sugar Baby<br><br>\u201cThis is getting out of hand... My play time raised to over 2 hours per day. Also I'm neglecting my social life.. Something about it is just... enchanting.\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 Lesbegue Integral<br>",
